<title>UK: Scotia H1 pre-tax loss widens, sales drop.</title>
<headline>Scotia H1 pre-tax loss widens, sales drop.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.2 loss	     vs 8.3 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     7.0		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   7.3		    vs 8.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The drug discovery and nutritional supplements company announced progress on its pancreatic cancer drug EF13 and said all its priority projects are developing successfully.  </p>
<p> Operating loss	   7.6		    vs 5.9 loss</p>
<p> Exceptional loss	 0.6		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest received	1.2		    vs 0.5</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Attributable	     7.0		    vs 5.4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
